From 0838eefed82fbea4bab92f804124add1e20bdf98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWorlds <openworlds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 17:06:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] java.text, java.util and java.lang members the client and the
 bridge use

NumberFormat number and integer instances as the JDK's (grouped
thousands, half-even rounding, digit limits; formatting was plain
toString), DateFormat/NumberFormat.getAvailableLocales, Calendar.set
with a date and time, Calendar.clear, Date.UTC, Base64, CountDownLatch,
java.lang.management (the runtime's "pid@host" name and the operating
system bean), UnsatisfiedLinkError, PrintWriter on a file with an
encoding.
